# Idsem Authority

Start every substantive repository session at `AGENTS.md`.

`docs/spec/constitution.md` is the sole semantic law. `CLAUDE.md`,
`docs/spec/AUTHORITY.md`, `docs/bootstrap.md`, `.agents/AGENT_CANONICAL.md`,
and `.agents/AGENT_COORDINATION.md` are projections and routers.

History, legacy `.duo` source, generated binaries, editor memories, chat
histories, and machine caches are not Idsem law. Identify the semantic owner
before editing, inspect HEAD and dirty state, inspect gaps and claims, prefer
deletion or convergence over new mechanisms, and do not restore historical
architecture.
